  "description": "A world without lies. A world where criminals are caught, where words are always true, and people always say what they mean. Of course, Sae-Gye isn't like everyone else. He can lie. He can deceive and manipulate in order to get ahead. As long as no one else knows, he can do whatever he wants and get away clean. As long as no one else knows... \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
